# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/prefill-2 window (the device-side hand-off of the final step's GDN state; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/prefill-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-pf2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a smoke job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint (what production serves) from its own converted-weight directory; the keys are the same
# in every smoke job of this pack, so each pair differs by the profile alone. The prefix steps (AP1, R1, R2) do not forward the selection into their container and serve the base checkpoint: the hand-off moves
# the GDN state of a finished prefill, whose shape and bytes the checkpoint does not change.
# T4 (TIMED, the ARM of the second smoke pair): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf2-s4, the control with QWEN_FAST_PREFILL_HANDOFF=1 and nothing else, the
# same tests as T3, on Swift. TIMED: the ARC runner sets are at ZERO for this job (ORDER.txt, ARC-ZERO); no build, no CI push, no other job beside it. READ: c2_smoke_check
# clean; the lines in the container log: "[PINDIAG] lever N route installed: route=1 audit=0 merged=COLD,CHECKPOINT,SCRATCH,PARKED handoff=device" once; on the arms
# "[PINDIAG] prefill handoff engaged mode=device layers=48 clones=240" once and one "[PF2] handoff mode=device ms=.. read_ms=0.0 clone_ms=.. write_ms=.. layers=48" per
# final step; on the control one "[PF2] handoff mode=host ms=.. read_ms=.. write_ms=.. layers=48" per final step and no "engaged" line; no "fell back" line and no program
# growth after the warm anywhere. Then, after the four boots of the pair (T1 T2 T3 T4): python3 -B scripts/ci/pf2_report.py --control <T1 container log> --control <T3
# container log> --arm <T2 container log> --arm <T4 container log>: the hand-off milliseconds per final step of the host path against the device path (count, mean, median,
# p90), the saving per final step and the route milliseconds of the final steps by context band; exit 0 needs the arm's engaged line, no fell-back or mismatch line and a
# host-only control. The cold ladder's TTFTs: python3 -B scripts/ci/prefill_ladder_report.py <T1 results> --second <T2 results> (and the same for T3 T4): a ratio below 1 is
# the arm faster; the answer text of every rung must be EQUAL between the arms (greedy, same checkpoint). The control-to-control floor is T1 against T3. CHECKPOINT READ
# (the workflow passes c2_smoke_check.py --expect-checkpoint): the container log holds "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a key=...
# weight_cache=.../weights-ckpt/<key> base_cache=... (the base cache is not read or written)" once, a "weight cache ...: found" line (the cache the Swift window built; this
# pack never builds it) and the worker's "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint bound ..." line; the models answer names ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b. TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1,
# scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step; the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. A
# rate difference that comes with a different loaded AICLK between the arms is the clocks, not the lever. Duration (estimate): 55 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf2-s4
C2_MODEL_REPO=ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b
C2_MODEL_REVISION=b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,parked_turns,prefill_ladder_solo,prefill_few_decoders,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=90
